# Terraform local state - this workshop uses local state only.
# A real project would use a remote backend (S3 + DynamoDB, Terraform
# Cloud, etc.) so state is never only on one laptop.
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan

# Real variable values - never commit secrets or account-specific values.
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example

crash.log
.DS_Store
